0rolls/day</span></p> <p align="left" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Customer''s own requirement is available for us. Such as : buyer''s own printed OEM logos,private label,particular size and private package styles.</span></p> <span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''> <p align="center" style=''color:#59595B;text-indent:20pt;font-family:"font-size:22px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;''> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">TEST REPORT</span></p> <p align="left" style=''color:#59595B;text-indent:20pt;font-family:"font-size:22px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;''> <br/></p> <table border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style=''text-align:left;color:#59595B;font-family:"font-size:22px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;'' width="756"> <tbody> <tr> <td colspan="3" style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="243"> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">SIMPLES: GOLDEN YELLOW</span></p> </td> <td colspan="2" style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="163"> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">SPECIFICATION</span></p> </td> <td colspan="2" style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="189"> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">MANUFACTURING DATE</span></p> </td> <td colspan="2" style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="161"> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">INSPECTION DATE</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5" style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="406"> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font